---
import pkg from '../../../package.json';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>pokéharness</title>
<meta name="description" content="pokéharness turns every claude, codex, or cursor session running on your machine into a walker in a pixel-art garden — spawn one, watch it work, and see what it's doing without staring at a terminal.">
<meta property="og:title" content="pokéharness">
<meta property="og:description" content="pokéharness turns every claude, codex, or cursor session running on your machine into a walker in a pixel-art garden.">
<meta property="og:image" content="https://pokeharness.parthkohale.com/og.png">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png">

<style>
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Press Start 2P';
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-display: swap;
    src: url('/fonts/press-start-2p-latin-400.woff2') format('woff2');
  }
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Inter';
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 400 700;
    font-display: swap;
    src: url('/fonts/inter-latin-var.woff2') format('woff2');
  }
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono';
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 400 700;
    font-display: swap;
    src: url('/fonts/jetbrains-mono-latin-var.woff2') format('woff2');
  }

  :root {
    --ground-0: #17171B;
    --ground-100: #1D1D22;
    --ground-200: #26262C;
    --border: #787684;
    --ink-900: #DEDBD6;
    --ink-700: #B3B0AC;
    --ink-500: #96919F;
    --gold: #E8B740;
    --on-accent: #1A1320;
    --coral: #E08C82;
    --mint: #74C096;
    --sky: #6FB3C4;
    --lemon: #CFAA57;
    --lilac: #A896E3;
    --peach: #DFA57F;
    --font-display: 'Press Start 2P', monospace;
    --font-ui: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif;
    --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }

  html { color-scheme: dark; }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--ground-0);
    color: var(--ink-900);
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  a { color: var(--gold); }

  img { display: block; max-width: 100%; }

  :focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--gold);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .wrap {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }

  /* ── top wordmark ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .brand-row {
    padding: 24px 0 0;
  }
  .brand {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--gold);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  /* ── hero ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    padding: 56px 0 44px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -120px;
    right: -160px;
    width: 480px;
    height: 480px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(232, 183, 64, 0.16), transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .hero-text {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 640px;
  }
  .hero h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(32px, 6vw, 56px);
    line-height: 1.08;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    color: var(--ink-900);
  }
  .hero p.subhead {
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--ink-700);
    margin: 0 0 28px;
    max-width: 560px;
  }
  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 12px 22px;
    border-radius: 0;
    text-decoration: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    transition: opacity 120ms ease, box-shadow 120ms ease;
  }
  .btn:disabled {
    opacity: 0.5;
    cursor: default;
  }
  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--gold);
    color: var(--on-accent);
  }
  .btn-primary:hover:not(:disabled) {
    opacity: 0.9;
  }
  .btn-secondary {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--ink-900);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(120, 118, 132, 0.4);
  }
  .btn-secondary:hover:not(:disabled) {
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--gold);
  }
  .hero-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--ink-500);
  }
  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin: 0 0 10px;
  }

  /* ── demo frame ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .demo-shell {
    padding: 8px 0 8px;
  }
  .window-chrome {
    background: var(--ground-200);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(120, 118, 132, 0.2);
    padding: 8px 10px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 7px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .dot {
    width: 11px;
    height: 11px;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .dot-red { background: #FF5F57; }
  .dot-yellow { background: #FEBC2E; }
  .dot-green { background: #28C840; }
  .demo-frame-body {
    background: var(--ground-100);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(120, 118, 132, 0.2);
    border-top: none;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
  }
  /* The demo has its own internal breakpoints tuned for a real desktop app
     window and breaks down below ~800px of *iframe* width. Rather than let
     the iframe shrink (which would trigger those internal breakpoints and
     clip content), we render it at a fixed design width and scale the whole
     box down visually with a transform — the iframe always sees ~1040px of
     internal viewport, and the visitor sees it fit whatever space is
     available. 1040/650 keeps the same 16:10 ratio as the frame itself, so
     the scale factor is just container-width / 1040. */
  .demo-frame-scaler {
    width: 1040px;
    height: 650px;
    transform-origin: top left;
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
  }
  .demo-frame-scaler iframe {
    width: 1040px;
    height: 650px;
    border: 0;
    display: block;
  }
  .demo-intro {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--ink-700);
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    max-width: 640px;
  }
  .demo-below {
    margin-top: 20px;
  }
  .demo-tour-head {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .demo-tour-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-500);
  }
  .demo-playall {
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .demo-tour-grid,
  .demo-more-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(150px, 1fr));
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .demo-chip {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    text-align: left;
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink-900);
    background: var(--ground-200);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(120, 118, 132, 0.3);
    border: none;
    padding: 14px;
    min-height: 48px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: box-shadow 120ms ease, background 120ms ease, transform 80ms ease;
  }
  .demo-chip:hover:not(:disabled) {
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--gold);
  }
  .demo-chip:active:not(:disabled) {
    transform: translateY(1px);
  }
  .demo-chip:disabled {
    opacity: 0.5;
    cursor: default;
  }
  .demo-chip.is-playing {
    background: var(--gold);
    color: var(--on-accent);
    box-shadow: none;
  }
  .demo-more-grid .demo-chip {
    font-size: 13px;
    min-height: 42px;
    padding: 10px 12px;
  }
  .demo-loading {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--ink-500);
    margin: 0;
    padding: 14px 0;
  }
  .demo-caption {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--ink-700);
    margin: 16px 0 0;
    max-width: 720px;
    min-height: calc(1.5em * 3);
  }
  .demo-more {
    margin-top: 18px;
  }
  .demo-more summary {
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--ink-500);
    list-style: none;
    padding: 8px 0;
  }
  .demo-more summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }
  .demo-more summary::before {
    content: '▸ ';
    color: var(--gold);
  }
  .demo-more[open] summary::before {
    content: '▾ ';
  }
  .demo-mobile-note {
    display: none;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--ink-500);
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    max-width: 640px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .demo-mobile-note { display: block; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .demo-caption { min-height: calc(1.5em * 5); }
  }

  /* ── works with ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .works-with {
    padding: 40px 0;
    margin-top: 12px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(120, 118, 132, 0.2);
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    color: var(--ink-700);
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--ink-900);
    background: var(--ground-200);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(120, 118, 132, 0.25);
    padding: 5px 10px;
  }

  /* ── how it works ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .section {
    padding: 64px 0;
  }
  .section h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 22px;
    margin: 0 0 40px;
    color: var(--ink-900);
  }
  .how-steps {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 56px;
  }
  .how-step {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 48px;
  }
  .how-media,
  .how-text {
    flex: 1 1 0;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .how-step-num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .how-text h3 {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    color: var(--ink-900);
  }
  .how-text p {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--ink-700);
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 440px;
  }
  .how-media img {
    width: 100%;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(120, 118, 132, 0.2);
  }
  .install-card {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 2.1;
    background: var(--ground-100);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(120, 118, 132, 0.2);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--gold);
    padding: 26px 24px;
    color: var(--ink-700);
  }
  .install-line {
    white-space: pre;
  }
  .install-file {
    color: var(--ink-900);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  /* ── feature grid ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .features {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .feature-card {
    background: var(--ground-100);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(120, 118, 132, 0.2);
    border-left-width: 3px;
    border-left-style: solid;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .feature-media {
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
    background: var(--ground-200);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .feature-media img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .feature-media.solid {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 26px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }
  .feature-body {
    padding: 16px 18px 20px;
  }
  .feature-body h3 {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    color: var(--ink-900);
  }
  .feature-body p {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: var(--ink-700);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ── footer ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  footer {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(120, 118, 132, 0.2);
    padding: 32px 0 48px;
  }
  .footer-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .disclaimer {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--ink-500);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  /* ── responsive ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .how-step { flex-direction: column; }
    .features { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .features { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .hero h1 { font-size: 30px; }
    .demo-tour-grid,
    .demo-more-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  }
  @media (max-width: 420px) {
    .demo-tour-grid,
    .demo-more-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="wrap brand-row">
  <div class="brand">pokéharness</div>
</div>

<header class="hero wrap">
  <div class="hero-text">
    <h1>your coding agents, as pokémon in a garden</h1>
    <p class="subhead">pokéharness turns every claude, codex, or cursor session running on your machine into a walker in a pixel-art garden — spawn one, watch it work, and see what it's doing without staring at a terminal.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://github.com/mavericksxx/pokemon-harness/releases/latest">download for mac</a>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://github.com/mavericksxx/pokemon-harness">browse the source</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-tag">v{pkg.version} · free, local, no accounts, no cloud</div>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="wrap demo-shell">
  <p class="eyebrow">live demo</p>
  <p class="demo-intro">this is the real app running in your browser, not a recording — click any scene below to watch it happen.</p>
  <div class="window-chrome">
    <span class="dot dot-red"></span>
    <span class="dot dot-yellow"></span>
    <span class="dot dot-green"></span>
  </div>
  <div class="demo-frame-body" id="demo-frame-body">
    <div class="demo-frame-scaler" id="demo-frame-scaler">
      <iframe id="demo-iframe" src="/demo.html?embed=1" title="pokéharness live demo"></iframe>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="demo-below">
    <div class="demo-tour-head">
      <span class="demo-tour-label">try it — click any scene</span>
      <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary demo-playall" id="demo-btn-showreel" disabled>loading…</button>
    </div>
    <div class="demo-tour-grid" id="demo-tour-grid">
      <p class="demo-loading">loading tour…</p>
    </div>
    <p class="demo-caption" id="demo-caption">loading the live demo — give it a second.</p>
    <details class="demo-more" id="demo-more">
      <summary id="demo-more-summary">more controls</summary>
      <div class="demo-more-grid" id="demo-more-grid">
        <p class="demo-loading">loading…</p>
      </div>
    </details>
    <p class="demo-mobile-note">the garden view above is scaled down to fit small screens — it's easiest to see the pixel detail and hover effects on a bigger one.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<script>
  (function () {
    var DESIGN_WIDTH = 1040;
    var body = document.getElementById('demo-frame-body');
    var scaler = document.getElementById('demo-frame-scaler');
    if (!body || !scaler) return;
    function fit() {
      var scale = body.clientWidth / DESIGN_WIDTH;
      scaler.style.transform = 'scale(' + scale + ')';
    }
    fit();
    window.addEventListener('resize', fit);
  })();
</script>
<script>
  (function () {
    var iframe = document.getElementById('demo-iframe');
    var tourGrid = document.getElementById('demo-tour-grid');
    var moreGrid = document.getElementById('demo-more-grid');
    var moreSummary = document.getElementById('demo-more-summary');
    var caption = document.getElementById('demo-caption');
    var playAllBtn = document.getElementById('demo-btn-showreel');
    if (!iframe || !tourGrid || !moreGrid || !playAllBtn || !caption) return;

    // Every button on this page is built from window.pokeDemo.scenes (see
    // tools/demo/template.html's SCENES table) — never hand-listed here, so
    // the marketing page can't drift from what the demo actually exposes.
    var api = null;
    var chips = [];
    var showreelActive = false;

    function setCaption(text) {
      caption.textContent = text;
    }

    function setBusyUI(isBusy) {
      chips.forEach(function (chip) {
        chip.disabled = isBusy;
        if (!isBusy) chip.classList.remove('is-playing');
      });
      if (!isBusy) {
        showreelActive = false;
        playAllBtn.disabled = false;
        playAllBtn.textContent = 'play the full tour';
      } else if (showreelActive) {
        playAllBtn.disabled = false;
        playAllBtn.textContent = 'stop';
      } else {
        playAllBtn.disabled = true;
      }
    }

    function makeChip(scene) {
      var btn = document.createElement('button');
      btn.type = 'button';
      btn.className = 'demo-chip';
      btn.textContent = scene.label;
      btn.disabled = true;
      btn.addEventListener('click', function () {
        if (!api || api.busy) return;
        setCaption(scene.caption);
        chips.forEach(function (c) { c.classList.remove('is-playing'); });
        btn.classList.add('is-playing');
        api.run(scene.id);
      });
      chips.push(btn);
      return btn;
    }

    function render(scenes) {
      var tour = scenes.filter(function (s) { return s.group === 'tour'; }).sort(function (a, b) { return a.order - b.order; });
      var controls = scenes.filter(function (s) { return s.group === 'control'; }).sort(function (a, b) { return a.order - b.order; });

      tourGrid.innerHTML = '';
      tour.forEach(function (scene) { tourGrid.appendChild(makeChip(scene)); });

      moreGrid.innerHTML = '';
      controls.forEach(function (scene) { moreGrid.appendChild(makeChip(scene)); });

      if (moreSummary) moreSummary.textContent = 'show every control (' + controls.length + ')';
      if (tour[0]) setCaption(tour[0].caption);
    }

    function enable() {
      chips.forEach(function (c) { c.disabled = false; });
      playAllBtn.disabled = false;
      playAllBtn.textContent = 'play the full tour';
    }

    playAllBtn.addEventListener('click', function () {
      if (!api) return;
      if (!showreelActive) {
        showreelActive = true;
        setCaption('running the full tour, one scene at a time.');
      }
      api.run('showreel');
    });

    // Same-origin iframe (served from this site), so this is direct property
    // access on contentWindow, not postMessage. demo.html's own inline
    // script defines window.pokeDemo synchronously while it boots, but the
    // outer iframe's 'load' event can fire before that — poll briefly
    // instead of relying on 'load'.
    var tries = 0;
    var poll = setInterval(function () {
      tries++;
      var found = iframe.contentWindow && iframe.contentWindow.pokeDemo;
      if (found) {
        clearInterval(poll);
        api = found;
        render(api.scenes);
        api.ready.then(enable);
        iframe.contentWindow.addEventListener('pokedemo:busy', function (e) {
          setBusyUI(e.detail.busy);
        });
      } else if (tries > 100) {
        clearInterval(poll);
        tourGrid.innerHTML = '<p class="demo-loading">demo unavailable</p>';
        moreGrid.innerHTML = '<p class="demo-loading">demo unavailable</p>';
        playAllBtn.disabled = true;
        playAllBtn.textContent = 'demo unavailable';
      }
    }, 100);
  })();
</script>

<div class="wrap works-with">
  <span>works with the coding-agent cli you already have</span>
  <span class="tag">claude</span>
  <span class="tag">codex</span>
  <span class="tag">cursor-agent</span>
</div>

<section class="section wrap">
  <p class="eyebrow">how it works</p>
  <h2>from zip to garden in about a minute</h2>
  <div class="how-steps">
    <div class="how-step">
      <div class="how-media">
        <div class="install-card">
          <div class="install-line install-file">Pokéharness.zip</div>
          <div class="install-line">→ drag to /Applications</div>
          <div class="install-line">→ right-click, open, open</div>
          <div class="install-line">→ never asks again</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="how-text">
        <div class="how-step-num">01</div>
        <h3>download and open it</h3>
        <p>one .zip, drag it to applications. gatekeeper asks once — right-click, open, open. that's the whole install.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="how-step">
      <div class="how-text">
        <div class="how-step-num">02</div>
        <h3>spawn a session</h3>
        <p>point it at a project folder and pick a pokémon, or let it pick a random starter. it launches claude, codex, or cursor-agent right there, the same as running it in a terminal.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="how-media">
        <img src="/screenshots/garden.png" alt="a few walkers roaming the garden, mid tool-call, with speech bubbles above them">
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="how-step">
      <div class="how-media">
        <img src="/screenshots/battle.png" alt="two walkers squared up mid-battle, move text overhead">
      </div>
      <div class="how-text">
        <div class="how-step-num">03</div>
        <h3>watch it work</h3>
        <p>tool calls show as a speech bubble and a walk to the right spot in the garden. subagents spawn as battles. long sessions evolve. everything you'd see scrolling past in the terminal, you now see from across the room.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section wrap">
